Lebedev quadrature tables
-------------------------
``enerzyme/models/so3/data/lebedev_grids.npz`` is copied from Google e3x
(https://github.com/google-research/e3x, file ``e3x/so3/_lebedev_grids.npz``)
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. EFA loads it via
``enerzyme.models.so3.lebedev`` (re-exported from ``enerzyme.models.efa.lebedev``).

